WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.644
The smoke test proves the deployment
end to end on objects nobody depends on,

2
00:00:04.644 --> 00:00:07.925
and you write each expected
result down before it runs.

3
00:00:07.925 --> 00:00:12.525
The synthetic app must appear in the
register with two owners and no secret.

4
00:00:12.525 --> 00:00:15.250
The synthetic service
account must be rated high.

5
00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:18.869
A new secret on the synthetic
app must be refused,

6
00:00:18.869 --> 00:00:21.312
and if it isn't, it's removed at once.

7
00:00:21.312 --> 00:00:24.350
The federated credential
must match exactly.

8
00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:29.375
Each workload policy must be report-only,
with the synthetic assigned directly.

9
00:00:29.375 --> 00:00:33.537
The sign-ins must show the
report-only results, from a beta read.

10
00:00:33.537 --> 00:00:37.460
And the test host must retrieve the
group managed account's password.
